  "description": "Comparison, regression testing and accessibility checks for PDF and Word documents in .NET. PDiffy reads what a document says (tag structure, text, alt text, reading order, tables, links, fonts, forms, styles and layout), not how the file is encoded, and reports meaningful changes element by element, and for a PDF on the page where they happened. Compare any two documents, test generated ones against approved snapshots, or inspect a typed model directly. Text and JSON snapshots use the same workflow.",
